{"title":"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/3/f63e5cdde0398d1f82ed66dcace31a78decb074c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{5}\\sum_{n=1}^{6}kn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"78\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each value of k, the sum is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff44e142706634c6b622c52c1e9cdd8ce72ebdce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1k+2k+3k+4k+5k+6k=21k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"277\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ece57303070e94f87b72a98fb1024cd47ef71e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{5}21k=21*15=\\boxed{315}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"198\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST\">2006 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</